@startuml
skinparam DefaultTextAlignment center
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #F9F9F9

[*] --> PaymentPending : Student Initiates Purchase (UC-05)
PaymentPending --> PaymentFailed : Verification Fails
PaymentFailed --> [*]

PaymentPending --> FundsOnHold : Payment Verified (Enrollment Granted) (FR-PAY-03)

FundsOnHold --> ReleasedToBalance : Hold Period Expires Safely (24h / 7d) (FR-PAY-04, 05)
FundsOnHold --> RefundRequested : Student Submits Refund Request (UC-06)

RefundRequested --> FundsOnHold : Admin Rejects Request (Returns to Hold Status)
RefundRequested --> ProcessingRefund : Admin Approves Refund (UC-23)

ProcessingRefund --> RefundedAndAdjusted : Refund Succeeds (Balance Adjusted)
ProcessingRefund --> RefundFailed : Financial Transaction Fails
RefundFailed --> ProcessingRefund : Retry Reconciliation

ReleasedToBalance --> [*]
RefundedAndAdjusted --> [*]
@enduml